{"id":17283,"date":"2023-10-09T10:36:45","date_gmt":"2023-10-09T16:36:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17283"},"modified":"2025-02-27T17:40:34","modified_gmt":"2025-02-27T22:40:34","slug":"newsletter-oct-2023-vol-10-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-oct-2023-vol-10-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: Oct 2023 (Vol 10.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17283\" class=\"elementor elementor-17283\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a0c084c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a0c084c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-585ac1b\" data-id=\"585ac1b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8435b2f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8435b2f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We\u2019re on the road all month and have exciting content coming your way! If we don\u2019t see you at upcoming conferences, we hope you can drop in for one of the webinars we have planned for you!<\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-17287 alignleft mobileFullWidth\" style=\"border-radius: 10px; margin: 3%;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faba-happy-hour-rethinkbh.jpg\" alt=\"RethinkBH booth at FABA\" width=\"225\" height=\"auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faba-happy-hour-rethinkbh.jpg 480w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faba-happy-hour-rethinkbh-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" \/><\/p><h2>We loved seeing you at FABA!<\/h2><p>Congrats to Angelis C &amp; Madisyn S for winning the contest for the most creative Taylor Swift ABA lyrics! We enjoyed seeing everyone at happy hour and the exhibit booth and talking to you about Analytics coming later this year!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-32d8fbd elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"32d8fbd\" data-element_type=\"section\" id=\"employeeSpotlight\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-490d37f\" data-id=\"490d37f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fe7228 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3fe7228\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/kelsey-larson-customer-success-manager-rethinkbh.jpg\" alt=\"Kelsey Larson, Customer Success Manager for RethinkBH\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">Kelsey Larson,<em> Customer Success Manager<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> Long Island, NY<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite food:<\/strong> Italian!<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite singer:<\/strong> Luke Combs<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite TV show:<\/strong> Grey\u2019s Anatomy<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>What do you like most about working for Rethink?<\/strong> I love the company culture. The goal-oriented leadership is something that motivates me to work hard everyday. I feel very supported and welcome!<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8872bff vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8872bff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/pumpkin.webp\" alt=\"cartoon jack-o-lantern\" width=\"125\" height=\"auto\" \/>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">October 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-e2fa34a elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e2fa34a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b7ce51b\" data-id=\"b7ce51b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-beeb31d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"beeb31d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"767\" height=\"767\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/steps-success-build-policies-procedures-templates-aba-business-rethinkbh.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-17296\" alt=\"BCBAs going over their ABA practices policies\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/steps-success-build-policies-procedures-templates-aba-business-rethinkbh.jpg 767w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/steps-success-build-policies-procedures-templates-aba-business-rethinkbh-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/steps-success-build-policies-procedures-templates-aba-business-rethinkbh-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 767px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-8beea70\" data-id=\"8beea70\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec01b9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ec01b9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">Steps to Success: How to Build Policies, Procedures &amp; Templates for your ABA Business<\/h3><p><strong>Tue, Oct 3rd @ 1 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>There are many steps to establishing and scaling an ethical ABA practice. From budgeting and projections to service coordination, each step is an integral part of building a foundation for sustainable growth. <a href=\"https:\/\/partnersaba.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Partners Behavioral Health<\/a> joins Rethink to break down one step &#8211; <em>Creating Policies, Procedures, &amp; Templates<\/em> &#8211; in this process and answer your questions!<\/p><p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/YKfFiox6MFY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View on-demand webinar today<\/a><\/strong>!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-2ab4b29 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2ab4b29\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-d754ca2\" data-id=\"d754ca2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28ae7da elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"28ae7da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">Results: The Science-Based Approach to Better Productivity, Profitability, and Safety<\/h3><p><strong>Tue, Oct 17th @ 1 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>How can leaders or coworkers deliver better results? Drs. Bridget Taylor and John Austin will discuss evidence-based strategies for producing measurable improvements in ABA organizations, including how to improve relationships, improve retention, and increase psychological safety on your teams. 1 FREE Supervision CE is included.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorlive.com\/courses\/results-the-science-based-approach-to-better-productivity-profitability-safe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Sign me up<\/strong>!<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-1ef481c\" data-id=\"1ef481c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f799d58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f799d58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"767\" height=\"767\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-john-austin-rethinkbh-webinar.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-17297\" alt=\"Dr. John Austin\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-john-austin-rethinkbh-webinar.jpg 767w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-john-austin-rethinkbh-webinar-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-john-austin-rethinkbh-webinar-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 767px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-375dd3b elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"375dd3b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-08da899\" data-id=\"08da899\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b234b31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b234b31\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/rethinkbh-aba-conferences-autism-law-summit-nysaba-labaa-ignite.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-21116\" alt=\"Logos for Autism Law Summit, NYSABA, LABAA, and Ignite BABAT Conference\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/rethinkbh-aba-conferences-autism-law-summit-nysaba-labaa-ignite.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/rethinkbh-aba-conferences-autism-law-summit-nysaba-labaa-ignite-300x212.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-e4fc5cb\" data-id=\"e4fc5cb\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6eec7c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6eec7c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">Where We\u2019ll Be &#8211; October 2023<\/h3>\nWe\u2019re making stops in NY, LA, MA, &amp; WI this month! We hope you can join us at one of the following conferences and learn more about Analytics and the remainder of our 2024 roadmap!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a908e99 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a908e99\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-940ba50\" data-id=\"940ba50\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f25e4d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f25e4d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>In Case You Missed It<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4f61565 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4f61565\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-537fadd\" data-id=\"537fadd\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e813660 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e813660\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15088\" alt=\"ABA After Hours, A podcast presented by Rethink Behavioral Health\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04c700a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"04c700a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 4%;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/episode\/2ZamRwcAb82mMGO9yEACe8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Practice Spotlight: <br class=\" elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile\" \/>Behavior Genius<\/a><\/h3><p>Portia James is back to talk about her journey as a BCBA entrepreneur and how she overcame barriers such as COVID shutdowns to build a successful ABA practice. She discusses why celebrating <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/making-case-for-diversity-aba\/\">diversity<\/a> is important and what she&#8217;s doing to help Black behavior analysts achieve their goals.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-f3e309e\" data-id=\"f3e309e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15cd27c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"15cd27c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15088\" alt=\"ABA After Hours, A podcast presented by Rethink Behavioral Health\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26b2a98 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"26b2a98\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 4%;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/episode\/6hTl2fKlmMLGwblvcIoDLt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Practice Spotlight: <br class=\" elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile\" \/>Behavior Basics, Inc<\/a><\/h3>\nThe amazing women behind Behavior Basics joined the All About ABA podcast to talk about their many initiatives to support their staff, including a BCBA residency program, utilization of performance scorecards for all staff, and more!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-03f1858 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"03f1858\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a8a0aa0\" data-id=\"a8a0aa0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1eb4c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a1eb4c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Practice Management Features<\/h2><p>Did you know about the following features available on the Rethink platform? If not, use the links below to guide you and improve your experience!<\/p><ul style=\"line-height: 2;\"><li><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3373072775\/Appointment+Reminders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appointment reminders<\/a> via email and SMS for clients and staff<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3700621313\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drag &amp; drop<\/a> appointments to change the date and\/or time<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3686826066\/Uncancel+Appointments+Website-Desktop+Only+Tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uncancel appointments<\/a> that were previously cancelled<\/li><li><strong>Exclude paycodes from Overtime<\/strong> calculations for payroll<\/li><li><strong>NJ ONLY &#8211; Group NPI added to HHAexchange<\/strong> integration for Electronic Visit Verification (EVV).<\/li><li>Electronic Visit Verification (EVV) now available for <strong>California<\/strong> through Sandata integration<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<br \/><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/2505900129\/BH+Releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View full list of recent releases<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5978fea elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"5978fea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div cl